+    # Same scraper/source plus a merely similar date is not identity evidence.
+    # Legacy/interpolated dates such as 2013-05-02 and 2013-07-02 are textually
+    # similar and previously generated unrelated manual-review pairs.
+    # A fuzzy headline alone is not enough for manual review: templated news
+    # headlines (awards, grants, publications) can be lexically very similar
+    # while referring to different people and facts. Require either substantial
+    # body similarity or meaningful subject-token overlap as well.
+    ambiguous = body_score >= .75 or (title_score >= .75 and overlap >= .4)
+    return (Classification.AMBIGUOUS if ambiguous else Classification.RELATED), \
+        max(title_score, body_score), evidence, []
 
 
